  "caption": "Cantonese kompa, Haitian dance-floor sway. Clean chorus-effect electric guitar rolling single-note arpeggios, kick drum with cowbell and floor-tom kata pattern, tanbou hand drum, round melodic electric bass, bright synth-brass keys playing the hook between vocal lines. Clean polished dance-floor mix, guitar and bass forward. Male tenor, bright, smooth and forward, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 100 BPM, F major. Flirty, teasing, swaying and playful. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no EDM drops, no distorted guitar, no slow ballad sections.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n三十五歲 返去黃大仙\n屋邨公園仲有張搖搖板\n你坐咗喺另一邊\n笑住話 好耐冇見\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n七歲嗰年 你壓住我\n我吊喺半空 唔肯放\n\n[Chorus]\n搖搖板 上上落落\n當年你重 而家我重\n你吊喺空中 輪到我\n我話求你 食餐飯好唔好\n\n[Verse]\n嗰年我雙腳離地\n嗌住話 放我落嚟\n你話要我講聲求你\n我講咗三次 先落地\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n今日我坐落去\n你就慢慢升高\n\n[Chorus]\n搖搖板 上上落落\n當年你重 而家我重\n你吊喺空中 輪到我\n我話求你 食餐飯好唔好\n\n[Verse]\n你兩隻腳 踢吓踢吓\n手捉實 條鐵欄杆\n我坐喺度 唔郁\n等你講句 好啦\n\n[Bridge]\n風吹過 條屋邨\n樓下阿婆 喺度笑\n你面紅紅 唔出聲\n\n[Chorus]\n搖搖板 上上落落\n當年你重 而家我重\n你吊喺空中 講聲好\n我話求你 食餐飯啦\n\n[Outro]\n搖搖板 搖搖板\n我話求你 食餐飯",
